    "description": "This dataset contains the edited ship's underway weather data collected in the Chukchi Sea during the 9 August - 3 September 2015 Arctic Marine Biodiversity Observing Network (AMBON) research cruise. The dataset is a .dat file consisting of wind direction, wind speed, air temperature, humidity, pressure, and travel speed measured at 15-second intervals along the ship' course.",
